From 8a82c50a6a3147ed14adb15a90bc7cb4322c0829 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 17:44:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(loader): add owned and file-backed weight routing

Upstream base: d05da62e9ccdf8e342b15bf6785d83224cc165af
Rationale: expose generic destination allocation, immutable safetensors ranges,
and deferred-copy completion without importing B12X policy into core vLLM.
Quality: transport-only; ordinary loaders preserve their prior copy semantics.
Tests: ruff, format, py_compile, and focused routing/unit tests; SM121 model-load
qualification remains required.
Upstream status: local carry intended for a focused vLLM contribution.

